3. Relationship with the upstream project
-----------------------------------------
    THIS IS AN UNOFFICIAL FORK. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
    supported by The Bored Team. Please do not report problems with this
    fork to the upstream project, and do not expect upstream to support it.

    The upstream project ships a Sparkle appcast signed with its own EdDSA
    key. This fork deliberately disables Sparkle (`feedURLString` returns
    nil) and carries no upstream public key, so an installation of Notch
    Island can never be silently replaced by the official Boring Notch
    build.


